 "text": "Hello! How's everything today? That's fine. A gift is anything that's thoughtfully made. Would you rather make one small item, or a batch of twenty little things? It is. Melted chocolate is the secret ingredient. Pour it into small cups and add grated chocolate or stroop waffle to the top. About ten minutes per cup. Pour slowly, add grated chocolate at the last minute, and let them cool on tray for twenty minutes. Pop them in a gift bag with a little note and they' perfect. People love homemade things, especially when they' thoughtful.",
